---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Alejandro Berrizbeitia"
  description="Narratives in numbers. Forecasting, causal inference, and AI-assisted analytics evaluation — decision systems built on data."
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-14 md:py-20">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-midnight dark:text-silver md:text-4xl">
      Narratives in numbers.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-3 font-serif text-lg text-midnight/90 dark:text-silver/90 md:text-xl">
      Forecasts, causal readouts, and AI-generated analysis built for decisions, not reports.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-8 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-muted dark:text-silver">
      I am a Senior Data Analyst at Kit and a Time Series and Forecasting professor at IE
      University. My work produces forecasts across statistical and foundation models, causal
      readouts from experiments and observational studies, and evaluations of AI-generated analysis
      for correctness and decision-readiness. The goal: analysis a team can act on. Semantic layer
      design is part of the infrastructure behind that work.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-16 space-y-14">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-midnight dark:text-silver">Building</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-ink-muted dark:text-silver">
          Public repositories and side projects. Active work and what is in progress.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4">
          <a
            href="/building/"
            class="font-medium text-midnight underline decoration-silver decoration-2 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-midnight dark:text-silver dark:hover:text-ink-dark"
          >
            View building →
          </a>
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-midnight dark:text-silver">Writing</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-ink-muted dark:text-silver">
          Newsletter issues and long-form pieces.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4">
          <a
            href="/writing/"
            class="font-medium text-midnight underline decoration-silver decoration-2 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-midnight dark:text-silver dark:hover:text-ink-dark"
          >
            View writing →
          </a>
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-midnight dark:text-silver">Shelf</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-ink-muted dark:text-silver">
          Books, papers, and essays worth returning to. Literature, history, analytics, philosophy
          of science.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
